{"v":4,"catch":"準備解決所有級別了嗎？","desc":"Fire & Water 是一款遊戲，您可以利用火與水的力量解決各種難題。 Water Girl和Fire boy一直在努力解決各種不同的，令人興奮的難題。控制兩個角色非常簡單，您必須幫助Fire Boy避免進水，而Water Girl需要避免開火。\n還有黑水可以殺死他們兩個。為了完成這些任務，您將需要使用後視鏡，電梯，風力機，滑輪，黑球和各種其他工具。您執行得越快，效果就會越好。\n特徵：\n令人印象深刻的益智遊戲\n超過30張地圖可玩\n使用滑輪，風力機和電梯\n逃脫迷宮，贏了","publisher":"Piotr Skalski","release":"2021-01-28","genres":["益智","動作","街機","冒險"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.3GB / Switch 0.3GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1776e1223ecd2763377a9d67036166d3e6096548af72c2d12296e107e4e9b4c1.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6f33bbf9838440a0aae8e0a6b2f9694b59616561f210000e580ebe87444c7107.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/bbf108f3366339b04de5205e49bc7bf4f01c0d0ef553cd5d743d47c96b1fa0bf.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/242a8d9e3af0be7afc6174b2144e6c7e789ee018f858cce6c6061c1fa6af0a54.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c0c08e728c4a642b3471a83b2fdcfdfaacbb6b1c776c2a441b1e5551ad62f654.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/2f526edf3c41c5b641eee595be52888c05cc2c2677aae945c9b1c6559719c17a.jpg"],"titleId":"0100f4e013aae000","dlc":[]}